// One C major chord, three places: open C shape, A shape at fret 3 (x-3-5-5-5-3), E shape at fret 8 (8-10-10-9-8-8).
// A shape: ring finger flattens across strings 4-2 (lf 4 = ring).
\title "C in three positions"
\tempo 80
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
